0:01:45.00 --> 0:03:15.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A group of British soldiers are shot at. Only one of them survives and rushes back behind French bunkers.)

0:04:30.00 --> 0:05:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A soldier digs up a grave for a dead comrade.)

0:06:30.00 --> 0:07:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Bombers raid the beach. The soldiers panic and then duck for cover. We see explosions - and a soldier getting blown up. We see corpses.)

0:09:45.00 --> 0:10:15.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see corpses.)

0:12:20.00 --> 0:15:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: The beach is bombed. Soldiers duck to take cover.)

0:16:00.00 --> 0:16:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a dogfight.)

0:18:40.00 --> 0:20:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: The dogfight continues. Two planes go down.)

0:24:40.00 --> 0:25:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see the wreckage of a plane.)

0:26:00.00 --> 0:28:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A bomber attacks the bridge. The bridge is hit a few times causing casualties. The ship is also hit - and starts sinking. Soldiers jump out and swim to safety.)

0:36:00.00 --> 0:41:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A British fighter plane is hit - and starts to go down. The pilot prepares to eject. A torpedo strikes the ship. The hall is flooded with water. The soldiers struggle to make to the escape. The soldier outside opens the door - and some of them manage to escape out. They jump in the water and swim to safety.)

0:41:46.60 --> 0:41:47.68
profane word 2 (for gods sake)

0:42:30.00 --> 0:49:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: During a dogfight, the plane goes down in the sea. The pilot is shown giving a thumbs up. The soldier swim to safety - but the lifeboat has no space. During a scuffle, a boy trips down stairs and suffers a major head injury. During a dogfight, a German plane is hit.)

0:50:35.00 --> 0:51:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a soldier walk into the ocean to kill himself. We see bodies in the ocean.)

0:58:41.56 --> 0:58:42.26
profane word 3 (fuck)

0:59:00.00 --> 0:59:55.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: German planes attack a ship - but are intercepted by British planes. One of the planes is hit.)

1:01:20.00 --> 1:12:50.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: The trawler is hit with bullets. The tide rises and water starts filling in the holes. One of the soldiers trying to plug the hole gets shot. The men take a vote to kick out someone. After a brief scuffle, the trawler starts floating in water - but continues to take fire. During a dogfight, a British plane goes down in the sea. The pilot tries to escape - but is unable to free himself. The pilot gets desperate as the cabin fills up with water. A boat closes in, breaks the glass and rescues the pilot. A ship is bombed - it starts tilting and then sinking. We see men jump in the water and swim to safety.)

1:06:48.95 --> 1:06:49.55
profane word 3 (fucking)

