sex word 1 (naked, AI flag)

1:08:49.24 --> 1:08:49.82
profane word 3 (shit)

1:15:40.00 --> 1:18:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A ship explodes. We see a dogfight - a few planes go down. The ship leaks out oil.)

1:18:30.00 --> 1:19:40.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: The boat starts to sink. The soldiers abandon. The French guy gets stuck inside, struggles to free himself and drowns to death.)

1:19:40.00 --> 1:25:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A soldier is rescued from a sunk ship. We learn about a death. A plane is hit by anti-air fire - it goes down in an oil path. Soldiers swim away from the sinking ship.)

1:25:00.00 --> 1:25:45.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: The water catches fire. The boat speeds out of danger - dragging a soldier with them. The soldiers left behind catch fire. We see the scene from underwater. We hear them scream in agony.)

1:28:30.00 --> 1:29:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A dive bomber attacks a boat - but is taken out by the British plane. It crashes in the sea.)

1:38:30.00 --> 1:38:50.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: The pilot sets the plane on fire. German soldiers close in.)
